n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}black\\text{-}box\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4BlackBoxSequence}_S(\\lambda,\\vec f)\\leftrightarrow \\vec f\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}{}^\\alpha\\lambda\\land\\forall g\\in{}^\\lambda\\lambda\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda:g\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}\\alpha=f_\\alpha\\},\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}black\\text{-}box\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4BlackBoxSequence}_S(\\lambda,\\vec f)\\leftrightarrow \\vec f\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}{}^\\alpha\\lambda\\land\\forall g\\in{}^\\lambda\\lambda\\;\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda:g\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}\\alpha=f_\\alpha\\},\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_\\alpha\">\\(f_\\alpha\\)</span> 的定义域被固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>；对任意全局函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\lambda\\to\\lambda\">\\(g:\\lambda\\to\\lambda\\)</span>，正确猜中的阶段组成平稳集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> 的上游定义同时保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 是正则基数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","loc